# ML-KEM private key encodings as content of the PKCS#8 privateKey field.
# Valid vectors are the three RFC 9935 (Appendix C.1) CHOICE alternatives of the
# example keys derived from the seed 000102...3f, plus the raw seed and the raw
# expanded key accepted for backwards compatibility (re-encoded as the RFC
# alternative given in Encoded). Invalid vectors are
# malformed variants of the ML-KEM-512 example key.

